    <p class={cardTitle}><a href="/how-it-works/" class="text-[color:var(--color-teal-dark)] hover:underline">Cortisol+</a></p>
    <p class={cardText}>A weighted wellness score from the HRV, sleep, heart rate and activity data it can get.</p>
    <p class={cardMuted}><strong>Check:</strong> which inputs you have, how the baseline works, and what the subscription unlocks.</p>
  </div>
  <div class={card}>
