    <p class={cardText}>Supports Apple Watch HRV readings through Apple Health. Not limited to phone-camera readings.</p>
    <p class={cardMuted}><strong>Check:</strong> how it measures, what data it can use, and which features your plan includes.</p>
  </div>
  <div class={card}>
    <p class={cardTitle}><a href="https://stresswatch.app/" class="text-[color:var(--color-teal-dark)] hover:underline">StressWatch</a></p>
