<h2>Compare explanations, not just numbers</h2>
<p><strong>If two apps give different scores on the same day, their formulas, baselines or inputs may differ.</strong> That alone doesn't show which one is medically right.</p>
<p>Try the <a href="/resources/stress-sleep-journal/">observation journal</a>. Ask yourself whether an app helps you understand your routine without making you read too much into a number.</p>

